  - m_Id: 34537983725588480
    m_Localized: This AR project brings Science to life through over 100 interactive
      modules across Biology, Chemistry, and Physics. Each module uses Augmented
      Reality to visually explain complex concepts, making learning more engaging,
      immersive, and fun. Designed for students and educators, the project helps
      simplify science topics through 3D models, animations, and interactive elements,
      accessible directly from a mobile device. It encourages curiosity, strengthens
      understanding, and supports visual learning. Regular updates will add new topics
      and features based on user feedback and curriculum needs.
